# Keep credentials, local state and unrelated native sources out of the image.
.git
.github
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/var
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/npm-debug.log*
backend/tests
deploy/tests
# These slash-containing patterns are rooted at the build context; do not use a
# bare `app` pattern because that can also hide the FastAPI `backend/app` tree.
app/**
docs/**
examples/**
README.md
Makefile
